The application must allow content creators, churches, podcasters, educators, businesses, and digital media professionals to create professional-looking video productions using realistic virtual studio environments.

The core concept is simple:

Transform an ordinary recording environment into a professional virtual production studio without requiring expensive physical studio equipment.

